{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Probe, capture or subscribe to a stream"},"description":"Starts kind probe (bounded observation, no sealed capture), capture (bounded retained evidence; until states stop conditions), or subscription (durable recording). Supply admitted connector_document_digest, registry_id and exact members; a subscription can instead name series_id, never both. secret_name references a saved credential and never accepts its value. Returns the resource id and observed state. May consume provider/workspace resources; the browser asks approval. Next: get_stream with that kind and id. A lost response is an unknown outcome: never repeat blindly.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"connector_document_digest":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"kind":{"const":"probe","type":"string"},"members":{"items":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:@/-]{0,255}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":4096,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"registry_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"seconds":{"maximum":900,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"secret_name":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{0,62}$","type":"string"}},"required":["kind","connector_document_digest","registry_id","members"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"connector_document_digest":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"kind":{"const":"capture","type":"string"},"members":{"items":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:@/-]{0,255}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":4096,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"registry_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"secret_name":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{0,62}$","type":"string"},"until":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bytes":{"maximum":8388608,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"events":{"maximum":10000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"seconds":{"maximum":600,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"type":"object"}},"required":["kind","connector_document_digest","registry_id","members","until"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"connector_document_digest":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"kind":{"const":"subscription","type":"string"},"members":{"items":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:@/-]{0,255}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":4096,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"no_data_timeout_seconds":{"maximum":604800,"minimum":60,"type":"integer"},"registry_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"secret_name":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{0,62}$","type":"string"},"series_id":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9-]{0,63}$","type":"string"},"volume_policy":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"max_bytes":{"maximum":1099511627776,"minimum":1048576,"type":"integer"},"max_duration_seconds":{"maximum":86400,"minimum":5,"type":"integer"}},"required":["max_bytes","max_duration_seconds"],"type":"object"}},"required":["kind","connector_document_digest","registry_id"],"type":"object"}],"type":"object"},"name":"start_stream","title":"Probe, capture or subscribe to a stream"}
